 794:Core/Src/main.c ****  * user-triggered. HAL refuses a transmit while gState is BUSY_TX, so wait out
 795:Core/Src/main.c ****  * any stream frame first rather than letting the reply be dropped. Bounded by
 796:Core/Src/main.c ****  * one frame time, ~360us at 2,097,000 baud.
